SYNTHESIS
  Phi_3=(p1-6p2+6p3)/343 is the correct signed three-far boundary target.
  Exact deviations concentrate on low relation-distance triples; AP triples like (15,18,21)
  expose three-body relations that pairwise screening alone can miss.
  The next proof step is a signed Abel bound for Delta_3-Phi_3 stratified by
  the full relation lattice, then induction to higher Newton orders.
